OL,3,GNEWSARace to save 1960s Windrush front
OL,4,Aroom exhibition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA temporary museum exhibition
OL,7,Frecreating a 1960s front room has
OL,8,Fproved so popular organisers say they
OL,9,Fare now in a race against time to find
OL,10,Fit a permanent home.
OL,12,FThe curator of the Dominican Front Room
OL,13,Fproject at Bristol's Watershed,
OL,14,Fbroadcaster Sherrie Eugene-Hart, said
OL,15,Fthe project was an important cultural
OL,16,Freference point.
OL,18,FEugene-Hart's project was supported by
OL,19,FBristol's longest-serving Black female
OL,20,Fpolice officer, Beverley Douglas and
OL,21,Ffeatures real Caribbean keepsakes
OL,22,Fcontributed by Bristol families.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
